Nothing is paid when you book. You settle at the base before you travel, by cash, card or bank transfer. Cancel more than 24 hours ahead for a full refund, and inside 24 hours we will try to move you to another date rather than charge you.

## Choosing in two minutes

Five or more people, or anyone who wants to set their own pace: private. Two to four people who do not mind company: shared evening. Travelling between June and September, or with young children: morning. Want the camp, the dinner and the show: evening. Want the dunes empty and the photographs clean: morning, and bring a wide lens.

We have run this base since 2020 and taken more than 17,000 guests into that dune field, which is long enough to know that the wrong package ruins a good evening more often than the wrong operator does.
